<title>UK: Low &amp; Bonar buys Rubicon.</title>
<headline>Low &amp; Bonar buys Rubicon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British packaging, plastics and specialised textiles group Low &amp; Bonar Plc said on Friday it had bought British folding carton manufacturer Rubicon Packaging Ltd for 9.0 million stg cash.</p>
<p>Low &amp; Bonar said the acquisition would strengthen its market position in the British food carton sector.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
